{
 "ImagesTwoNotesReadyToSend": {
  "name": "Images, Two notes, ready to send",
  "caption": "Two notes, ready to send.",
  "html": "<div class=\"kanso-story\"><div class=\"kanso-story__theme kanso-story__frame kanso-panel\"><div class=\"kanso-panel\"><div class=\"kanso-panel__header\"><span class=\"kanso-panel__title\">Images<span class=\"kanso-panel__qualifier\">1 of 3</span></span><span class=\"kanso-button--icon\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-lock\"/></svg></span><span class=\"kanso-button--icon\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-refresh-cw\"/></svg></span></div><div class=\"kanso-picture--annotated\">\n                <div class=\"kanso-picture__content\">\n                  <div class=\"kanso-content__heading\"><span>Your cart</span><span style=\"font-weight:400;color:var(--muted)\">3 items</span></div>\n                  <div class=\"kanso-picture__banner\">Prices held for 09:42</div>\n                  <div class=\"kanso-picture__line\"><span>Trail runner, 42</span><span>$64.00</span></div>\n                  <div class=\"kanso-picture__line\"><span>Wool socks ×2</span><span>$12.00</span></div>\n                  <div class=\"kanso-picture__line\"><span>Shipping</span><span>$8.00</span></div>\n                  <div class=\"kanso-picture__total\"><span>Total</span><span>$84.00</span></div>\n                  <div class=\"kanso-picture__action\">Checkout</div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"kanso-annotation\" style=\"left:78%;top:24%\">1</span>\n                <span class=\"kanso-annotation\" style=\"left:30%;top:88%\">2</span>\n              </div><div class=\"kanso-picture__thumbnails\"><span class=\"kanso-thumbnail kanso-button--inline-icon kanso-control--on\"><i style=\"top:6px;right:16px\"></i><i class=\"kanso-brand__wordmark\" style=\"top:12px\"></i><i style=\"top:22px\"></i><i style=\"top:29px\"></i></span><span class=\"kanso-thumbnail kanso-button--inline-icon\"><i style=\"top:10px;right:18px\"></i><i style=\"top:18px\"></i></span><span class=\"kanso-thumbnail kanso-button--inline-icon\"><i style=\"top:7px\"></i><i style=\"top:14px\"></i><i style=\"top:21px;right:10px\"></i><i style=\"top:28px;right:20px\"></i></span></div><div style=\"margin-top:var(--k-sp-4)\"><div class=\"kanso-panel__annotation kanso-row--interactive\"><span class=\"kanso-annotation\">1</span><span class=\"kanso-text--truncate\">The timer covers the item count on narrow screens</span><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--inline kanso-content__body\"><use href=\"#lu-x\"/></svg></div><div class=\"kanso-panel__annotation kanso-row--interactive\"><span class=\"kanso-annotation\">2</span><span class=\"kanso-text--truncate\">Checkout should say the held price, not a plain label</span><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--inline kanso-content__body\"><use href=\"#lu-x\"/></svg></div></div><div class=\"kanso-actions\"><span class=\"kanso-button\">Send to checkout</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Open</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Clear 2 pins</span></div></div></div></div>",
  "spec": [
   [
    "Anatomy",
    "the panel as the app draws it: header, scope, body from the kit primitives\nstate: Two notes, ready to send"
   ],
   [
    "Values",
    "panel 368 wide · padding 16 · rows 32 · meta 11.5 dim\nonly kit tokens; no colour but the marks"
   ],
   [
    "States",
    "Two notes, ready to send"
   ],
   [
    "Behaviour",
    "The panel skeleton: title 20 with \"1 of 3\" beside it. Stay on this agent and Refresh appear with the pointer; the lock stays while you have pinned it. The Send button names the agent."
   ],
   [
    "Principle",
    "Kansō"
   ]
  ]
 },
 "ImagesANewPinItsNoteTypedBesideIt": {
  "name": "Images, A new pin: its note typed beside it",
  "caption": "A new pin: its note typed beside it.",
  "html": "<div class=\"kanso-story\"><div class=\"kanso-story__theme kanso-story__frame kanso-panel\"><div class=\"kanso-panel\">\n              <div class=\"kanso-panel__header\"><span class=\"kanso-panel__title\">Images</span><span class=\"kanso-button--icon\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-lock\"/></svg></span><span class=\"kanso-button--icon\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-refresh-cw\"/></svg></span></div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-picture--annotated\" style=\"cursor:crosshair\">\n                <div class=\"kanso-picture__content\">\n                  <div class=\"kanso-content__heading\"><span>Your cart</span><span style=\"font-weight:400;color:var(--muted)\">3 items</span></div>\n                  <div class=\"kanso-picture__banner\">Prices held for 09:42</div>\n                  <div class=\"kanso-picture__line\"><span>Trail runner, 42</span><span>$64.00</span></div>\n                  <div class=\"kanso-picture__line\"><span>Wool socks ×2</span><span>$12.00</span></div>\n                  <div class=\"kanso-picture__line\"><span>Shipping</span><span>$8.00</span></div>\n                  <div class=\"kanso-picture__total\"><span>Total</span><span>$84.00</span></div>\n                  <div class=\"kanso-picture__action\">Checkout</div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"kanso-annotation\" style=\"left:78%;top:24%\">1</span>\n                <span class=\"kanso-annotation kanso-annotation--inactive\" style=\"left:84%;top:74%\">2</span><div class=\"kanso-annotation__note\" style=\"left:30%;top:80%\">Total should be bold<span class=\"kanso-panel__caret\"></span></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-panel__file\"><span>cart-countdown.png</span><span class=\"kanso-text--dim kanso-text--truncate\" style=\"font-size:var(--k-fs-meta)\">~/acme-shop/shots · 14:02</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\" style=\"margin-left:auto\">Open</span></div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-picture__thumbnails\"><span class=\"kanso-thumbnail kanso-button--inline-icon kanso-control--on\"><i style=\"top:6px;right:16px\"></i><i class=\"kanso-brand__wordmark\" style=\"top:12px\"></i><i style=\"top:22px\"></i><i style=\"top:29px\"></i></span><span class=\"kanso-thumbnail kanso-button--inline-icon\"><i style=\"top:10px;right:18px\"></i><i style=\"top:18px\"></i></span><span class=\"kanso-thumbnail kanso-button--inline-icon\"><i style=\"top:7px\"></i><i style=\"top:14px\"></i><i style=\"top:21px;right:10px\"></i><i style=\"top:28px;right:20px\"></i></span></div>\n              <div style=\"margin-top:var(--k-sp-4)\">\n                <div class=\"kanso-panel__annotation kanso-row--interactive\"><span class=\"kanso-annotation\">1</span><span class=\"kanso-text--truncate\">The timer covers the item count on narrow screens</span><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--inline kanso-content__body\"><use href=\"#lu-x\"/></svg></div>\n                <div class=\"kanso-panel__annotation kanso-row--interactive\"><span class=\"kanso-annotation\">2</span><span class=\"kanso-text--truncate\">Total should be bold</span><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--inline kanso-content__body\"><use href=\"#lu-x\"/></svg></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-actions\"><span class=\"kanso-button\">Send to checkout</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Open</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Clear pins</span></div>\n            </div></div></div>",
  "spec": [
   [
    "Anatomy",
    "the panel as the app draws it: header, scope, body from the kit primitives\nstate: A new pin: its note typed beside it"
   ],
   [
    "Values",
    "panel 368 wide · padding 16 · rows 32 · meta 11.5 dim\nonly kit tokens; no colour but the marks"
