 "ImagesItsAgentWaitsOnYouSent": {
  "name": "Images, Its agent waits on you · sent",
  "caption": "Its agent waits on you · sent.",
  "html": "<div class=\"kanso-story\"><div class=\"kanso-story__theme kanso-story__frame kanso-panel\"><div class=\"kanso-panel__column\">\n              <div class=\"kanso-panel\">\n                <div class=\"kanso-panel__header\"><span class=\"kanso-panel__title\">Images<span class=\"kanso-panel__qualifier\">cart-ui</span></span><span class=\"kanso-button--icon\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-lock\"/></svg></span><span class=\"kanso-button--icon\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-refresh-cw\"/></svg></span></div>\n                <div style=\"margin-top:var(--k-sp-4)\">\n                  <div class=\"kanso-panel__annotation kanso-row--interactive\"><span class=\"kanso-annotation\">1</span><span class=\"kanso-text--truncate\">Badge overlaps the cart icon at 320 px</span><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--inline kanso-content__body\"><use href=\"#lu-x\"/></svg></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kanso-state-block\"><svg class=\"kanso-mark kanso-mark--blocked\"><use href=\"#e-blk\"/></svg><div class=\"kanso-state-block__what\">cart-ui needs you first</div><div class=\"kanso-state-block__actions\"><span class=\"kanso-button--tonal\">Go to cart-ui</span></div></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-panel\">\n                <div class=\"kanso-panel__header\"><span class=\"kanso-panel__title\">Images<span class=\"kanso-panel__qualifier\">checkout</span></span><span class=\"kanso-button--icon\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-lock\"/></svg></span><span class=\"kanso-button--icon\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-refresh-cw\"/></svg></span></div>\n                <div class=\"kanso-panel__file\" style=\"margin-top:var(--k-sp-4)\"><span>cart-countdown.png</span><span class=\"kanso-text--dim\" style=\"font-size:var(--k-fs-meta)\">Sent to checkout 14:06</span></div>\n              </div>\n            </div></div></div>",
  "spec": [
   [
    "Anatomy",
    "the panel as the app draws it: header, scope, body from the kit primitives\nstate: Its agent waits on you · sent"
   ],
   [
    "Values",
    "panel 368 wide · padding 16 · rows 32 · meta 11.5 dim\nonly kit tokens; no colour but the marks"
   ],
   [
    "States",
    "Its agent waits on you · sent"
   ],
   [
    "Behaviour",
    "An agent that waits on you gets no Send; the line says \"cart-ui needs you first\", the PR panel's words."
   ],
   [
    "Principle",
    "Seijaku"
   ]
  ]
 },
 "ImagesAnotherComputerNotBroughtOverYet": {
  "name": "Images, Another computer: not brought over yet",
  "caption": "Another computer: not brought over yet.",
  "html": "<div class=\"kanso-story\"><div class=\"kanso-story__theme kanso-story__frame kanso-panel\"><div class=\"kanso-panel\">\n              <div class=\"kanso-panel__header\"><span class=\"kanso-panel__title\">Images<span class=\"kanso-panel__qualifier\">migrate on devbox</span></span><span class=\"kanso-button--icon\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-lock\"/></svg></span><span class=\"kanso-button--icon\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-refresh-cw\"/></svg></span></div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-picture--annotated\" style=\"height:200px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--canvas)\">\n                <div style=\"text-align:center\"><div style=\"font-size:var(--k-fs-name)\">schema-diagram.png</div><div class=\"kanso-text--dim\" style=\"font-size:var(--k-fs-body);margin-top:var(--k-sp-1)\">2.4 MB on devbox</div><div class=\"kanso-actions\" style=\"justify-content:center;margin-top:var(--k-sp-3)\"><span class=\"kanso-button\">Load</span></div></div>\n              </div>\n              </div></div></div>",
  "spec": [
   [
    "Anatomy",
    "the panel as the app draws it: header, scope, body from the kit primitives\nstate: Another computer: not brought over yet"
   ],
   [
    "Values",
    "panel 368 wide · padding 16 · rows 32 · meta 11.5 dim\nonly kit tokens; no colour but the marks"
   ],
   [
    "States",
    "Another computer: not brought over yet"
   ],
   [
    "Behaviour",
    "At rest only what you would miss: header icons appear with the pointer in the panel or keyboard focus; the scope line goes, and a panel's one qualifier (another computer, the month, the device, 1 of 3) sits beside the title in dim; second lines and row actions appear on pointer or selection; folds keep their word. States that need you are unchanged."
   ],
   [
    "Principle",
    "Kansō"
   ]
  ]
 },
 "ImagesAnotherComputerUnreachable": {
  "name": "Images, Another computer, unreachable",
  "caption": "Another computer, unreachable.",
  "html": "<div class=\"kanso-story\"><div class=\"kanso-story__theme kanso-story__frame kanso-panel\"><div class=\"kanso-panel\">\n              <div class=\"kanso-panel__header\"><span class=\"kanso-panel__title\">Images</span><span class=\"kanso-button--icon\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-lock\"/></svg></span><span class=\"kanso-button--icon kanso-button--spinning\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-refresh-cw\"/></svg></span></div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-panel__scope\">Read 14:02 · devbox unreachable · next try 14:07</div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-panel--stale\">\n                <div class=\"kanso-picture--annotated\" style=\"height:200px;background:var(--raised)\">\n                  <div class=\"kanso-picture__content\"><div class=\"kanso-content__heading\"><span>relay schema</span></div><div class=\"kanso-picture__line\"><span>events</span><span>12 cols</span></div><div class=\"kanso-picture__line\"><span>deliveries</span><span>9 cols</span></div><div class=\"kanso-picture__line\"><span>receivers</span><span>6 cols</span></div></div>\n                </div>\n                </div>\n            </div></div></div>",
  "spec": [
   [
    "Anatomy",
    "the panel as the app draws it: header, scope, body from the kit primitives\nstate: Another computer, unreachable"
   ],
   [
    "Values",
    "panel 368 wide · padding 16 · rows 32 · meta 11.5 dim\nonly kit tokens; no colour but the marks"
   ],
   [
    "States",
    "Another computer, unreachable"
   ],
   [
    "Behaviour",
    "Another computer: nothing large crosses the wire unasked. The picture is a name, its size and Load; thumbnails are the picture's colour until loaded. Unreachable keeps the last picture at 55%."
